{
  "$defs": {
    "GlossaryEntry": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "术语条目：source_term 在目标语言里锁定为 target_term；可选发音提示。\n\n- `preserve_source=True`：目标译文里必须原样保留（产品名/模型名 通常如此）；\n  与 target_term 二选一——preserve_source 时 target_term 强制等于 source_term。\n- `pronunciation`：给 TTS 参考的读音（IPA/拼音/自然拼写），本身不参与译文替换。\n- `notes`：给译者/审核的说明（如\"缩写读作字母\"）。",
      "properties": {
        "notes": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Notes"
        },
        "preserve_source": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Preserve Source",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "pronunciation": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Pronunciation"
        },
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "1",
          "description": "合同 schema 版本；Reader 需兼容当前与前一版本",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_term": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Source Term",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "target_term": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Target Term",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "source_term",
        "target_term"
      ],
      "title": "GlossaryEntry",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://videoforge.dev/schemas/glossary.schema.json",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "术语表（一对语言）。entries 里 source_term + source_language + target_language 唯一。",
  "properties": {
    "created_at": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Created At",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "entries": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/GlossaryEntry"
      },
      "title": "Entries",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "id": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "1",
      "description": "合同 schema 版本；Reader 需兼容当前与前一版本",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "source_language": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Source Language",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "target_language": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Target Language",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "version": {
      "default": 1,
      "minimum": 1,
      "title": "Version",
      "type": "integer"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "id",
    "source_language",
    "target_language",
    "created_at"
  ],
  "title": "Glossary",
  "type": "object"
}
